{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skipper, Dipper, and Mable are back! Having successfully crossed the Crystalline Sea in their last Great Adventure, they are ready for new challenges, harder puzzles and new obstacles - are you ready? Welcome to Skipper2: Hijinks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skipper2 is a fun, challenging, relaxing puzzle game with 25+ levels to bend your mind and challenge your problem solving ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skipper2's controls are simple and the game's difficulty has an approachable learning curve making puzzlers of all abilities able to easily dive into the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regular (free!) puzzle packs will drop for the game at least quarterly.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skipper2 brings you </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique challenges across 25+ puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SteamDeck Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most puzzles can be solved in more than one way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular drops of new puzzles for free</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard and Gamepad controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An environment as unique as it is relaxing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soothing sound track and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of Steam Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skipper2 Has between 1.5 and 4 hours of gameplay</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"caace91e3c771d24ac4f77da029e6d336f4ead2e.jpg","localized_name":"Complete Level 01","name":"Complete Level 01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/737240/caace91e3c771d24ac4f77da029e6d336f4ead2e.jpg"},{"icon":"27cdc4a29c43ccbc52d4e57f79b60a36cd049822.jpg","localized_name":"Complete Level 02","na